      "decision_index": 55,
    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "With a hand full of noncreature spells, leveling Artist's Talent to level 2 first (cost 2R) would reduce subsequent noncreature spells by {1} generic mana, enabling more spell chaining this turn. After leveling (3 mana), Sarge could cast Stormchaser's Talent (U, 1 mana) and Accumulate Wisdom (reduced to U, 1 mana) - casting 3 total noncreature spells for 3 Ral loyalty counters plus Artist's Talent draw triggers.",
