    },
    {
      "severity": "minor",
      "description": "Gem3F Sarge has untapped lands (Willowrush Verge, Steam Vents, Steam Vents, Stomping Ground - at least some should be untapped given only Spirebluff Canal is shown tapped) and could cast Accumulate Wisdom or Abandon Attachments at end of turn to use mana efficiently. Accumulate Wisdom costs 1U and would dig through the top 3 cards for the best one, and with Artist's Talent level 1 on board, casting a noncreature spell triggers the loot ability for additional card filtering. Passing with mana available and card draw spells in hand wastes mana that could be used to improve hand quality. Additionally, Ral gains a loyalty counter whenever a noncreature spell is cast, so casting spells here would also grow Ral toward his ultimate.",
