      "description": "Spell Pierce costs U to counter a noncreature spell unless the opponent pays {2}. The opponent (Gem3F Sarge) has an untapped Steam Vents available, meaning they can pay the {2} tax. Spell Pierce will likely be ineffective here, wasting the card. Additionally, Consult the Star Charts is just a card selection spell - not a must-counter threat. Meanwhile, Qwen3L Johnny has only 3 lands (one untapped Island) and is spending their only available mana on a likely-to-fail counter, when they could save it for something more impactful. Three Steps Ahead (counter mode) costs 1UU which they can't afford now, and Spell Snare counters MV 2 which Consult the Star Charts is (MV 2), making Spell Snare the strictly better choice here as it unconditionally counters it.",
